        },
        {
          "text": "E’yo ’disi emi ma ede wura apipi eminini, azini wura edro angu ezapi ’diyini, azini emi ma fe diza Mungu Israeliniri dri; kani eri nga ani dri nzizaru erini emi ma dria, adrou emini pie, angu emini pieri nze were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.5"
            ]
          }
